                "description": "Scalloped Green Glass Knob With Oval Floral Rose Fusion 20-D9 - The scallop cut of the Green Glass Knob makes it resemble a flower; and when it is paired with Fusion Hardware's Oval Floral Rose, the knobset is romantically Victorian in style. It is available in 6 finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
